{
  "category": "Cat Ferret Pokémon",
  "entries": [
    {
      "text": "Memories of battling its arch-rival SEVIPER are etched into every cell of ZANGOOSE’s body. This POKéMON adroitly dodges attacks with incredible agility.",
      "version": "ruby"
    },
    {
      "text": "ZANGOOSE usually stays on all fours, but when angered, it gets up on its hind legs and extends its claws. This POKéMON shares a bitter rivalry with SEVIPER that dates back over generations.",
      "version": "sapphire"
    },
    {
      "text": "When it battles, it stands on its hind legs and attacks with its sharply clawed forelegs. Its fur bristles if it encounters any SEVIPER.",
      "version": "emerald"
    },
    {
      "text": "If it comes across a SEVIPER, its fur bristles and it assumes its battle pose. Its sharp claws are its best weapon.",
      "version": "firered"
    },
    {
      "text": "If it comes across a SEVIPER, its fur bristles and it assumes its battle pose. Its sharp claws are its best weapon.",
      "version": "leafgreen"
    },
    {
      "text": "It has feuded with SEVIPER for many generations. Its sharp claws are its biggest weapons.",
